{"v":4,"catch":"一款以哥德式寓言為背景的工藝製作冒險遊戲。","desc":"《Wytchwood》是一款工藝製作冒險遊戲。故事背景發生在一塊充滿了哥德式寓言與童話的土地上，你將要做為森林中神祕的老女巫去探索這片奇異的土地，收集那些魔法原料，調配出各種巫術。然後用你那扭曲的認知來「教育」那些任性妄為的角色與生物吧！\n\n畢竟若是沒有你的「教育」，他們又怎麼能理解故事的寓意呢？","publisher":"Whitethorn Games","release":"2023-03-16","genres":["冒險","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 3.0GB / Switch 3.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d80b746decdfd8f5e671bc03d06ab13b46c1dc64d8a0617f530ff812fe817b55.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3ea800291317d702be7ad13f8ac19d81c8302eb1550a5da03480d4f99cd451ba.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/98f693825f7f5b3ade32fd04b459a1378a0f8cc84290a7567028d228052fd5be.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac19288c0c7588955d6dc55c86702f5563d043222c0d5a09a46f9f87178ac0b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1c931dc5d40bfe13b0173263ad07383b9dcbaa5898d6a2410f6f372586e6998f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/010d75d0daea766d07c7f79c28ce6eb1af23f8fc93adabe7ac81562b4b185ccc.jpg"],"titleId":"01003750154d6000","dlc":[]}